title: "Exact values and an all-dimensions upper bound for binary 2-cover-free families (A286874)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mahajan
    given-names: Siddhartha
  - family-names: Chopra
    given-names: Paras
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-07
abstract: >-
  Exact certificates for A286874(15)=42 and A286874(17)=68, together with
  the unrestricted bound 48 <= A286874(16) <= 54 and an explicit universal
  private-chain upper bound for every n >= 3.
keywords:
  - cover-free families
  - disjunct matrices
  - Steiner systems
  - OEIS
